  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2d1141843791c3b42bd93196d7a97662, type: 3}
  m_Name: Note06_Memo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ItemData
  itemName: Memo to all sector managers, Pangea Laboratories
  itemDescription: Running on borrowed time
  fullNoteContent: "TO: All Sector and department managers\n\nFROM: Todd Milford,
    Laboratory Director, Pangea Laboratories\n\nDATE: 02.07.2006\n\nSUBJECT: Results\n\n\nWe
    NEED results, we are already on thin ice and time is not on our side.\n\nThe
    government is already close to shutting us down, if we don\u2019t show them something
    then all of our jobs are on the line and I\u2019m hard pressed to believe that
    it will end well for any of us. \n\nSo that\u2019s why I\u2019m fast tracking
    work on The Core Project, we need to have it ready by the end of this year at
    the latest in order to conduct the first experiment early next year, no further
    delays. \n\nFurthermore I\u2019m assigning Sofia to oversee this project, from
    now on any and all progress and updates is to be reported directly to her, I
    will focus on buying us time so we can at least meet this new deadline."
  type: 1
  icon: {fileID: 0}
